{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41155","headline":"星回节游避风台与清平官赋 · 南诏骠信","name":"星回节游避风台与清平官赋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"避风善阐台，极目见藤越。\n悲哉古与今，依然烟与月。\n自我居震旦，翊卫类夔契。\n伊昔颈皇运，艰难仰忠烈。\n不觉岁云暮，感极星回节。\n元昶同一心，子孙堪贻厥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"南诏骠信","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}